  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;Is the&nbsp;lightest element ever and is a&nbsp;tasteless, odourless, colourless, and highly combustible gas.&nbsp;It&#39;s also in most organic compounds</p><p>Hydrogen is a highly inflammable gas. This is because it burns in air to give water.&nbsp;</p><p>The reaction is as follows:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8203;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8203;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8203;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
